        <title>RustDelhi Meetup#12</title>
        <published>2026-01-17T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2026-01-17T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>
            
              Unknown
            
          </name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://rustdelhi.in/events/20260117/"/>
        <id>https://rustdelhi.in/events/20260117/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="https://rustdelhi.in/events/20260117/">&lt;p&gt;Hi folks, Rust Delhi hosted another meetup on Saturday, January 17, 2026. It was a fantastic event that brought together Rust enthusiasts for talks, discussions, and networking.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The venue was graciously provided by our friends at &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;aftershoot.com&quot;&gt;Aftershoot&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;, at Nexus Towers, Saket!&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;event-agenda&quot;&gt;Event Agenda:&lt;&#x2F;h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introductions.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&quot;Stop reprocessing everything: Incremental data pipelines with CocoIndex&quot; by &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;haleshot&quot;&gt;Haleshot&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&quot;Oxidizing our beloved Delhi Metro&quot; by &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;keogami&quot;&gt;keogami&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&quot;The fault in our traits&quot; by &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;lunchspider&quot;&gt;lunchspider&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&quot;Exploring Stream Processing in Rust with RS2&quot; by &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;rajany080&quot;&gt;Rajan Yadav&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&quot;A primer on terminal visualisation and practical profiling in Rust&quot; by &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;draconacht&quot;&gt;draconacht&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Session by Aftershoot.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Group Photo &amp;amp; Finish.&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ol&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;gallery&quot;&gt;Gallery&lt;&#x2F;h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out the photos from the event on our &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ishan.gallery.aftershoot.com&#x2F;rustdelhi&quot;&gt;Aftershoot Gallery&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;!&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
</content>
        
    </entry>
