        <content type="html" xml:base="https://rustdelhi.in/events/20240824/">&lt;p&gt;Hi folks, Rust Delhi is hosting another monthly meetup this time at Office Spark in East Delhi on Saturday, 24th August. This month&#x27;s meetup is centered around Rust and its ecosystem.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;event-agenda&quot;&gt;Event Agenda&lt;&#x2F;h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduction Session&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fun with Type system by Prabhat &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;artech-git&quot;&gt;@artech-git&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Porting an SDK from JS to Rust - My Experience by Sathyajith P S &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener nofollow noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;github.com&#x2F;sathyajithps&quot;&gt;@sathyajithps&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking Break&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lightning Talks from attendees (if any)&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hiring&#x2F;Pitching session&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;ol&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;gallery&quot;&gt;Gallery&lt;&#x2F;h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Prabhat&#x27;s talk.
        &lt;br&#x2F;&gt;
